# Clinical Documentation Workflow Flowcharts

## 1. As-Is Workflow (Current Process)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B["Doctor conducts patient consultation"]
    B --> C["Scribe receives consultation information"]
    C --> D["Scribe prepares clinical note"]
    D --> E["Scribe corrects documentation mistakes"]
    E --> F["Doctor reviews the clinical note"]
    F --> G{"Is the note accurate and complete?"}
    G -- No --> H["Note returned for correction"]
    H --> E
    G -- Yes --> I["Doctor approves the note"]
    I --> J["Note is finalized in the EHR"]
    J --> K([End])
```

## 2. To-Be Workflow (Proposed Process)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B["Doctor conducts patient consultation"]
    B --> C["Authorized consultation information is supplied to AI"]
    C --> D["AI generates draft clinical note"]
    D --> E["Scribe reviews the AI-generated draft"]
    E --> F["Scribe corrects documentation errors"]
    F --> G["Doctor checks clinical accuracy"]
    G --> H{"Are corrections required?"}
    H -- Yes --> I["Return note for correction"]
    I --> E
    H -- No --> J["Doctor approves the note"]
    J --> K["Note is saved or finalized in the correct EHR record"]
    K --> L([End])
```
